.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 

.PP
.nf
Representation of a single message in a catalog\&.
.fi
.PP
 
.SH "Constructor & Destructor Documentation"
.PP 
.SS " None babel\&.messages\&.catalog\&.Message\&.__init__ ( self, \fB_MessageID\fP id, \fB_MessageID\fP | None  string = \fC''\fP, Iterable[tuple[str, int]]  locations = \fC()\fP, Iterable[str]  flags = \fC()\fP, Iterable[str]  auto_comments = \fC()\fP, Iterable[str]  user_comments = \fC()\fP, \fB_MessageID\fP  previous_id = \fC()\fP, int | None  lineno = \fCNone\fP, str | None  context = \fCNone\fP)"

.PP
.nf
Create the message object\&.

:param id: the message ID, or a ``(singular, plural)`` tuple for
           pluralizable messages
:param string: the translated message string, or a
               ``(singular, plural)`` tuple for pluralizable messages
:param locations: a sequence of ``(filename, lineno)`` tuples
:param flags: a set or sequence of flags
:param auto_comments: a sequence of automatic comments for the message
:param user_comments: a sequence of user comments for the message
:param previous_id: the previous message ID, or a ``(singular, plural)``
                    tuple for pluralizable messages
:param lineno: the line number on which the msgid line was found in the
               PO file, if any
:param context: the message context

.fi
.PP
 
