.SS " bool babel\&.messages\&.catalog\&.Message\&.fuzzy ( self)"

.PP
.nf
Whether the translation is fuzzy\&.

>>> Message('foo')\&.fuzzy
False
>>> msg = Message('foo', 'foo', flags=['fuzzy'])
>>> msg\&.fuzzy
True
>>> msg
<Message 'foo' (flags: ['fuzzy'])>

:type:  `bool`
.fi
.PP
 
